-- הסכם קיבוצי (22.7.2013) — דחיית המועד להקצאת הפעימה האחרונה של עלות הסכם
-- המסגרת: the teaching employees' share in the 2013–2014 fiscal measures.
-- It covers the State's teaching employees; puts off the framework
-- agreement's last allocation, due from 1.7.2013 under §155(א) of the base
-- agreement at the rate §92(ג) of the completion agreement set, to
-- 1.1.2015 — the pension, budgetary-pension, severance and bridging-pension
-- payments for 1.7.2013–31.12.2014 being computed as if it had been made on
-- time; cuts the clothing allowance for תשע"ג and תשע"ד, the same payments
-- again computed as if it had not been cut; starts on 1.7.2013; and keeps
-- the earlier agreements and the exhaustion and industrial-peace
-- provisions.
--
-- It changes what the base agreement and the completion agreement set, so
-- it imports them: the completion agreement's §92 rates and its coverage
-- record (§§91–92 reach every teaching employee in the civil service, as
-- §3 here does), the base agreement's §155(א) ways of applying a framework
-- cost and §153(א) on earlier terms. The Accountant General's clothing
-- levels and the clothing agreements on the eve of this one (that of
-- 19.7.2011 among them) are not in the corpus: named inputs.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`

-- The day the agreement was signed.
`the signing of the deferral agreement` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 22 7 2013

-- The period §§5 and 7 protect, its last day in it (convention dates.end).
`the protected period opens on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013
`the protected period closes on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2014

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the period §§5 and 7 protect` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the protected period opens on` AND d `is on or before` `the protected period closes on`

§ `הסכם דחיית הפעימה האחרונה של עלות הסכם המסגרת — 22.7.2013`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (18.11.2013, no. 215/2013); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The date of signing, encoded above as `the signing of the deferral agreement`.
-- akn:preamble/p4 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The first party, the State, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The first party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "And between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The second party, the teachers' union, and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The second party's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the State's fiscal stability was shaken in the last two years; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the need to adjust the State's spending and income for 2013 and 2014; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the employees' temporary share in the burden, as this agreement sets out; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the participation law of 2013 (temporary provision), in force from 1.7.2013, whose §3 puts off a pay rise or cut by the collective agreement that applies; the law is not in the corpus, and the clauses below carry what the parties agreed.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: the parties negotiated and reached what this agreement sets out; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 המבוא`

-- akn:art_1 The heading of §1.

DECLARE `part of the deferral agreement` IS ONE OF
    `the deferral agreement's preamble`
    `the deferral agreement's body`
    `one of the deferral agreement's annexes`

@ref akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN p IS A `part of the deferral agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the deferral agreement` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the deferral agreement` `the deferral agreement's preamble` AND `binds as the deferral agreement` `one of the deferral agreement's annexes`

§§ `2 לשון`

-- "unless expressly stated otherwise": a word written in one form reads in
-- every other (the completion agreement's own forms, imported).
@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `written in` IS A `grammatical form`, `read in` IS A `grammatical form`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the deferral agreement reads in another form` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    (NOT `expressly limited`) OR `written in` EQUALS `read in`

#ASSERT `a word of the deferral agreement reads in another form` `the masculine` `the plural` FALSE

§§ `3 תחולה`

-- akn:art_3 The heading of §3.

-- Every employee in the civil service ranked on the teaching employees'
-- scale ("עובדי הוראה"), those in supervision and staff roles among them,
-- wherever employed: the reach the completion agreement gives its §§91 and
-- 92 (imported), whose allocation §4 puts off.
@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee under the completion agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the deferral agreement` e IF
    `covered by §§91 and 92` e

`a supervisor on the teaching scale` MEANS
    `employee under the completion agreement` WITH
        `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` IS TRUE
        `in the civil service`                    IS TRUE
        workplace                                 IS `another workplace`
#ASSERT `covered by the deferral agreement` `a supervisor on the teaching scale`
#ASSERT NOT `covered by the deferral agreement` (`employee under the completion agreement` WITH `ranked on the teaching employees' scale` IS TRUE, `in the civil service` IS FALSE, workplace IS `a primary school`)

§§ `4 דחיית המועד להקצאת הפעימה האחרונה של עלות הסכם המסגרת`

-- akn:art_4 The heading of §4.

-- The allocation due from 1.7.2013 under §155(א) of the base agreement, at
-- the rate §92(ג) of the completion agreement set (the 6.35% the 2011
-- supplement reaches; imported), is put off to 1.1.2015. Until then the
-- rate stays where §92(ב) left it on 30.6.2013.
@ref akn:art_4/p1
`the last allocation was due on` MEANS `1 July 2013`
`the last allocation is put off to` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2015

GIVEN `the rate before 1.1.2012` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as deferred` `the rate before 1.1.2012` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the last allocation was due on` AND NOT d `is on or after` `the last allocation is put off to`
    THEN `the 2011 supplement rate under §92` `the rate before 1.1.2012` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2013)
    ELSE `the 2011 supplement rate under §92` `the rate before 1.1.2012` d

#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as deferred` (2.5%) `1 July 2013` EQUALS 5.75%
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as deferred` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2014) EQUALS 5.75%
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as deferred` (2.5%) `the last allocation is put off to` EQUALS `the 2011 supplement rate from 1 July 2013`
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as deferred` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2013) EQUALS 5.75%
-- The period put off is the period §§5 and 7 protect, day for day.
#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL `the last allocation is put off to` EQUALS DATE_SERIAL `the protected period closes on` PLUS 1
#ASSERT `the protected period opens on` EQUALS `the last allocation was due on`

§§ `5 תשלומים המחושבים כאילו לא נדחתה ההקצאה`

DECLARE `payment computed as if not cut` IS ONE OF
    `a payment for a teaching employee to a provident fund for a pension`
    `a budgetary pension payment`
    `a one-time payment on ending work`
    `a bridging pension payment`
    `another payment`

-- ¶1, (א)–(ד): for 1.7.2013–31.12.2014 these four are computed as if the
-- allocation had been made on time, and the cost applied by §155(א)(1) and
-- (2) — a uniform rise of the reform tables for one on the reform, a
-- separate supplement line for one off it (the base agreement's §155,
-- imported). (ג) is "a one-time payment the State pays a teaching employee
-- on ending his work, by law or agreement"; §7(ג) adds "or a public
-- employer", which changes nothing here, §3 reaching State employees only.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_c akn:art_5__para_d
GIVEN k IS A `payment computed as if not cut`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a payment §§5 and 7 protect` k IF
    NOT k EQUALS `another payment`

GIVEN k IS A `payment computed as if not cut`, `the rate before 1.1.2012` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement rate a payment is computed at` k `the rate before 1.1.2012` d IS
    IF `a payment §§5 and 7 protect` k AND `in the period §§5 and 7 protect` d
    THEN `the 2011 supplement rate under §92` `the rate before 1.1.2012` d
    ELSE `the 2011 supplement rate under §92, as deferred` `the rate before 1.1.2012` d

GIVEN `under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `way of applying a framework cost`
DECIDE `the way §5 takes the deferred cost as applied` `under the reform` IS
    `how a framework cost is applied` 90 FALSE `under the reform`

#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate a payment is computed at` `a budgetary pension payment` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) EQUALS 6.35%
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement rate a payment is computed at` `another payment` (2.5%) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013) EQUALS 5.75%
#ASSERT `the way §5 takes the deferred cost as applied` TRUE EQUALS `a uniform rise of the reform salary tables`
#ASSERT `the way §5 takes the deferred cost as applied` FALSE EQUALS `a separate supplement line, and the shekel supplements raised by it`

§§ `6 קצובת ביגוד`

-- akn:art_6 The heading of §6.

-- ¶1: notwithstanding any collective agreement or other provision on
-- teaching employees.
@ref akn:art_6/p1
`§6 overrides the clothing allowance of every other provision` MEANS TRUE

-- (א): for תשע"ג, 1,877 for all teaching employees.
@ref akn:art_6__para_a
`the clothing allowance for 5773` MEANS 1877

-- (ב)(1)–(2): for תשע"ד, 84% of the Accountant General's amount for level
-- 3 to one whose seniority reaches 25 years, 25 included ("ועד בכלל"), and
-- for level 4 to one above 25. The levels' amounts are the Accountant
-- General's (not in the corpus): an input.
@ref akn:art_6__para_b akn:art_6__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_b__subpara_2
ASSUME `the Accountant General's clothing amount for level` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER

`the share of the level paid in 5774` MEANS 84%

GIVEN `seniority in years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing level for 5774` `seniority in years` IS
    IF `seniority in years` AT MOST 25 THEN 3 ELSE 4

GIVEN `seniority in years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing allowance for 5774` `seniority in years` IS
    `the share of the level paid in 5774` TIMES `the Accountant General's clothing amount for level` (`the clothing level for 5774` `seniority in years`)

-- The text answers the bound on purpose: 25 years is level 3, a day more
-- is level 4.
#ASSERT `the clothing level for 5774` 25 EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `the clothing level for 5774` 25.01 EQUALS 4

§§ `7 תשלומים המחושבים כאילו לא הופחתה קצובת הביגוד`

-- ¶1, (א)–(ד): for 1.7.2013–31.12.2014 the same four payments are computed
-- as if the clothing allowance had been paid by the collective agreements
-- on the eve of this one, that of 19.7.2011 among them (not in the corpus;
-- an input, by school year and seniority).
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_c akn:art_7__para_d
ASSUME `the clothing allowance by the agreements on the eve of 22.7.2013` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER AND NUMBER TO NUMBER

-- `school year` is the calendar year it opens in: 2012 for תשע"ג, 2013 for
-- תשע"ד.
GIVEN `school year` IS A NUMBER, `seniority in years` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing allowance paid under §6` `school year` `seniority in years` IS
    IF `school year` EQUALS 2012
    THEN `the clothing allowance for 5773`
    ELSE `the clothing allowance for 5774` `seniority in years`

GIVEN k IS A `payment computed as if not cut`, `school year` IS A NUMBER, `seniority in years` IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing allowance a payment is computed on` k `school year` `seniority in years` d IS
    IF `a payment §§5 and 7 protect` k AND `in the period §§5 and 7 protect` d
    THEN `the clothing allowance by the agreements on the eve of 22.7.2013` `school year` `seniority in years`
    ELSE `the clothing allowance paid under §6` `school year` `seniority in years`

#ASSERT `the clothing allowance a payment is computed on` `another payment` 2012 10 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2013) EQUALS 1877

§§ `8 תחילה`

-- akn:art_8 The heading of §8.

@ref akn:art_8/p1
`the deferral agreement starts on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013

#ASSERT `the deferral agreement starts on` EQUALS `the last allocation was due on`

§§ `9 הסכמים קודמים`

-- akn:art_9 The heading of §9.

-- An earlier term stays in force in this agreement's term unless this
-- agreement amended or cancelled it, expressly or by implication — the
-- rule §153(א) of the base agreement sets for that one (imported).
@ref akn:art_9/p1
GIVEN `amended or cancelled by the deferral agreement` IS A BOOLEAN, `within its term` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier term stays in force beside the deferral agreement` `amended or cancelled by the deferral agreement` `within its term` IF
    `an earlier term stays in force` `amended or cancelled by the deferral agreement` `within its term`

#ASSERT NOT `an earlier term stays in force beside the deferral agreement` TRUE TRUE

§§ `10 מיצוי תביעות ושקט תעשייתי`

@ref akn:art_10
`the deferral agreement takes away from the exhaustion and industrial-peace provisions` MEANS FALSE

